@ TAHA (replaces Steven): loves A SONG OF ICE AND FIRE (the books are better than the show), is waiting
@ for a PIRATE SOULS game to come out, and is obsessed with a mythical force called MUAH.
@ The villain admins. With OMAR, waking HALEEB: KROOMA (replaces Matt: VALHEIM, ARAMs, HALEEB is his
@ love) and YAHYA (replaces Shelly: HALEEB is a G; when he loses, he missed his Q). With AHMED, on
@ CEASER's side: HAMADA (replaces Tabitha: HURRRRRR, NAIRRRRRRR) and KHALI IBRAHIM (takes Tabitha's
@ Magma Hideout battle: CEASER was stolen from him, and he wants him back).
@ Each boss also has his real number one, in a grunt's battle near the end of each team's base:
@ IDRIS for OMAR (Seafloor Cavern) and MOSTAFA for AHMED (Magma Hideout).
@ ZAABY (replaces Mr. Stone, DEVON's PRESIDENT) is selling VILLA 74 and isn't giving TAHA any of
@ the money he promised him.

@@ file: data/maps/GraniteCave_StevensRoom/scripts.inc
GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_ImStevenLetterForMe:
	.string "My name is TAHA.\p"
	.string "I'm rereading A SONG OF ICE AND\n"
	.string "FIRE. The books, not the show.\p"
	.string "The books are SO much better.\p"
	.string "Oh?\n"
	.string "A LETTER for me?$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_ThankYouTakeThis:
	.string "TAHA: Okay, thank you.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "ZAABY sold VILLA 74, and I get\n"
	.string "NOTHING? He promised me!\p"
	.string "Sorry. You came all this way to\n"
	.string "deliver that. I need to thank you.\p"
	.string "Let me see…\n"
	.string "I'll give you this TM.\p"
	.string "It contains my favorite move,\n"
	.string "STEEL WING.$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_CouldBecomeChampionLetsRegister:
	.string "TAHA: Your POKéMON have something.\n"
	.string "I can feel it. It's MUAH.\p"
	.string "You don't know MUAH? The force that\n"
	.string "flows through all things?\p"
	.string "Nobody knows about MUAH. Yet.\p"
	.string "Let's register each other in our\n"
	.string "POKéNAVS.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_IveGotToHurryAlong:
	.string "Now, I've got to hurry along.\n"
	.string "The RED WEDDING won't reread itself.$"

@@ file: data/maps/FortreeCity_House3/scripts.inc
FortreeCity_House3_Text_MetStevenHadAmazingPokemon:
	.string "While speaking about POKéDEXES,\n"
	.string "I remembered something.\p"
	.string "I met this TRAINER, TAHA, when\n"
	.string "I was searching for rare stones.\p"
	.string "He talked about some force called\n"
	.string "MUAH for an hour.\p"
	.string "But, hoo, boy, he had some amazing\n"
	.string "POKéMON with him.\p"
	.string "He might even be stronger than the\n"
	.string "GYM LEADER in this town…$"

@@ file: data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc
Route118_Text_StevenQuestions:
	.string "TAHA: Hi, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "It's me, TAHA!\n"
	.string "We met in the cave near DEWFORD.\p"
	.string "Have you seen the show? Don't.\n"
	.string "Read the books.\p"
	.string "And have you felt the MUAH yet?\p"
	.string "You will. Every TRAINER does,\n"
	.string "sooner or later.\p"
	.string "It would be nice if we were to meet\n"
	.string "again somewhere.$"

@@ file: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc
Route120_Text_StevenGreeting:
	.string "TAHA: Hm? {PLAYER}, hi.\n"
	.string "It's been a while.\p"
	.string "There's something here that you\n"
	.string "can't see, right?\p"
	.string "MUAH is hiding it. Probably.\p"
	.string "Rather than explain, I'll show you.\n"
	.string "That would be more fun.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, are your POKéMON ready for\n"
	.string "battle?$"

Route120_Text_StevenGiveDevonScope:
	.string "TAHA: I see…\n"
	.string "Your battle style has MUAH.\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON have grown since\n"
	.string "we met in DEWFORD.\p"
	.string "I'd like you to have this\n"
	.string "DEVON SCOPE.\p"
	.string "Who knows, there may be other\n"
	.string "concealed POKéMON.$"

Route120_Text_StevenGoodbye:
	.string "TAHA: {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "If PIRATE SOULS ever comes out,\n"
	.string "we're playing it together.\p"
	.string "Any day now.\p"
	.string "Well, let's meet again somewhere.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc
MossdeepCity_Text_StevensHouseOverThere:
	.string "TAHA's house is right over there!\n"
	.string "He says it's full of MUAH.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc
MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_StevenAreYouReadyToBattle:
	.string "TAHA: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "You're going to help me?\p"
	.string "Like the NORTH, I'll remember this!\n"
	.string "Are you ready?$"

MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_StevenThankYouComeSeeMeAtHome:
	.string "TAHA: Whew, that was too tense.\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}, thank you.\p"
	.string "I have something to give you as\n"
	.string "thanks for your support.\p"
	.string "Come see me at home after this.\n"
	.string "I live right here on this island.$"

MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_Text_TabithaDefeat:
	.string "… hurrrr$"

@@ file: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc
MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_YouveEarnedHMDive:
	.string "TAHA: {PLAYER}…\p"
	.string "There's not much here.\n"
	.string "Just my books. All five of them.\p"
	.string "Still waiting on the sixth.\p"
	.string "This is my token of appreciation.\n"
	.string "It's the HIDDEN MACHINE DIVE.\p"
	.string "No need to be shy--you've earned\n"
	.string "this HM.$"

MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_LetterFromSteven:
	.string "It's a letter.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "To {PLAYER}…\p"
	.string "I've gone to search for the source\n"
	.string "of MUAH.\p"
	.string "I won't be home for a while. Maybe\n"
	.string "not until PIRATE SOULS comes out.\p"
	.string "I want you to take the POKé BALL on\n"
	.string "the desk.\p"
	.string "Inside it is a BELDUM, my favorite\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I'm counting on you.\p"
	.string "And read the books. Not the show.\p"
	.string "TAHA$"

MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_CollectionOfRareRocks:
	.string "A shelf of A SONG OF ICE AND FIRE\n"
	.string "books, and a few rare stones.$"

@@ file: data/maps/Route128/scripts.inc
Route128_Text_StevenWholeWorldWillDrown:
	.string "This is terrible…\p"
	.string "After the scorching heat wave ended,\n"
	.string "this deluge began.\p"
	.string "Winter isn't coming. Rain is.\p"
	.string "This huge rain cloud is spreading\n"
	.string "from above SOOTOPOLIS…\p"
	.string "SOOTOPOLIS might provide answers…$"

@@ file: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc
SootopolisCity_Text_HereWereAreHelpWallace:
	.string "TAHA: Okay, here we are!\p"
	.string "Inside, you'll find someone you\n"
	.string "know. Your dad, HISHAM.\p"
	.string "I think you have what's needed\n"
	.string "to help him…$"

SootopolisCity_Text_SoThatsRayquaza:
	.string "TAHA: So that's SNICKERS…\p"
	.string "Forget dragons. That's MUAH itself.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MeteorFalls_StevensCave/scripts.inc
MeteorFalls_StevensCave_Text_ShouldKnowHowGoodIAmExpectWorst:
	.string "TAHA: Oh, wow, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "I'm amazed you found me.\p"
	.string "I'm waiting here for PIRATE SOULS\n"
	.string "to come out.\p"
	.string "They haven't announced it yet.\n"
	.string "But any day now.\p"
	.string "We battled side by side at the\n"
	.string "MOSSDEEP SPACE CENTER.\p"
	.string "You know how good I am.\p"
	.string "Okay, {PLAYER}, show me your MUAH!\n"
	.string "Expect the worst!$"

MeteorFalls_StevensCave_Text_StevenDefeat:
	.string "You…\n"
	.string "Your MUAH is stronger than mine…$"

MeteorFalls_StevensCave_Text_MyPredictionCameTrue:
	.string "TAHA: Ever since we met in GRANITE\n"
	.string "CAVE, I had a feeling.\p"
	.string "I thought that you would eventually\n"
	.string "become the CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "My predictions usually come true.\n"
	.string "Unlike the show's last season.\p"
	.string "And where will you go from here?\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "Fufufu, even MUAH can't tell me that.$"

@@ file: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc
AquaHideout_B2F_Text_MattIntro:
	.string "KROOMA: Hehehe…\n"
	.string "Got here already, did you?\p"
	.string "I was about to hop on VALHEIM.\n"
	.string "Or queue up an ARAM.\p"
	.string "But first, I protect HALEEB.\n"
	.string "She's my love. My one true love!\p"
	.string "I'm going to pulverize you!$"

AquaHideout_B2F_Text_MattDefeat:
	.string "Hehehe…\n"
	.string "GG. I'll get the next ARAM.$"

AquaHideout_B2F_Text_MattPostBattle:
	.string "Hehehe!\p"
	.string "OMAR already left for the cave\n"
	.string "under the sea!\p"
	.string "He's going to wake up HALEEB.\n"
	.string "My HALEEB.\p"
	.string "If you're going after him, search\n"
	.string "the big, wide sea beyond LILYCOVE.\p"
	.string "Then hop on VALHEIM with me.\n"
	.string "Hehehe!$"

@@ file: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F/scripts.inc
Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ShellyIntro:
	.string "YAHYA: Ahahahaha!\p"
	.string "You're going to meddle in TEAM\n"
	.string "BEANIE's business?\p"
	.string "We're finding HALEEB.\n"
	.string "HALEEB is a G. A real G.\p"
	.string "And you're going to stop a G?\n"
	.string "I'll put you down, kiddy!$"

Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ShellyDefeat:
	.string "No way!\n"
	.string "I missed my Q!$"

Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ShellyPostBattle:
	.string "I missed my Q. That's the only\n"
	.string "reason. Run it back.\p"
	.string "HALEEB is still a G, by the way.$"

@@ file: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room3/scripts.inc
SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_ShellyIntro:
	.string "YAHYA: Ahahahaha!\p"
	.string "How did you get here without\n"
	.string "a submarine?\p"
	.string "HALEEB is waking up. Because\n"
	.string "HALEEB is a G.\p"
	.string "And this time, I'm hitting my Q.\n"
	.string "Get ready!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_ShellyDefeat:
	.string "Ahahahaha!\p"
	.string "…I missed my Q again.$"

SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_ShellyPostBattle:
	.string "Ahahahaha!\n"
	.string "You're so darn strong.\p"
	.string "Shame you're not on TEAM BEANIE.\p"
	.string "You'd get to see HALEEB up close.\n"
	.string "The realest G there is.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc
MtChimney_Text_TabithaIntro:
	.string "HAMADA: HURRRRRR!$"

MtChimney_Text_TabithaDefeat:
	.string "… hurrrr$"

MtChimney_Text_TabithaPostBattle:
	.string "HAMADA: HURRRRRR…\p"
	.string "NAIRRRRRRR…$"

@@ file: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc
MagmaHideout_4F_Text_TabithaIntro:
	.string "KHALI IBRAHIM: You made it this far,\n"
	.string "so I'll tell you!\p"
	.string "Up ahead, CEASER is sleeping.\p"
	.string "He was mine. We had an unbreakable\n"
	.string "bond. Then he was stolen from me!\p"
	.string "AHMED went to wake him just now.\n"
	.string "But I'm getting CEASER back!$"

MagmaHideout_4F_Text_TabithaDefeat:
	.string "No… CEASER…\n"
	.string "Our bond was unbreakable…$"

MagmaHideout_4F_Text_TabithaPostBattle:
	.string "While you wasted time with me,\n"
	.string "AHMED went to CEASER…\p"
	.string "But CEASER will remember me.\n"
	.string "He has to. We had a bond!$"

@@ file: data/maps/SeafloorCavern_Room3/scripts.inc
SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_Grunt5Intro:
	.string "IDRIS: KROOMA and YAHYA think\n"
	.string "they're OMAR's number one.\p"
	.string "They're not. I am.\n"
	.string "OMAR texts me first.\p"
	.string "You want OMAR? You go through\n"
	.string "his real number one!$"

SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_Grunt5Defeat:
	.string "OMAR's going to hear about this…\n"
	.string "From me. First.$"

SeafloorCavern_Room3_Text_Grunt5PostBattle:
	.string "KROOMA and YAHYA? Interns.\p"
	.string "I'm the one who knows where OMAR\n"
	.string "keeps his beanies.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc
MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt13Intro:
	.string "MOSTAFA: HAMADA? KHALI IBRAHIM?\n"
	.string "Please.\p"
	.string "I'm AHMED's number one. I'm the\n"
	.string "only one with the new password.\p"
	.string "You're not getting by me!$"

MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt13Defeat:
	.string "AHMED's going to change the\n"
	.string "password again…$"

MagmaHideout_4F_Text_Grunt13PostBattle:
	.string "Don't tell HAMADA I lost.\n"
	.string "He'll just say HURRRRRR.$"

@@ file: data/maps/RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F/scripts.inc
RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_Text_MrStoneIHaveFavor:
	.string "I'm ZAABY, the PRESIDENT of\n"
	.string "the DEVON CORPORATION.\p"
	.string "I'd just got word about you!\p"
	.string "You saved our staff not just once,\n"
	.string "but twice!\p"
	.string "I'm a busy man. I'm selling\n"
	.string "VILLA 74. Big sale. Huge.\p"
	.string "Anyway, I have a favor to ask.\p"
	.string "You're delivering a package to\n"
	.string "SLATEPORT's SHIPYARD, right?\p"
	.string "On the way, could you stop off in\n"
	.string "DEWFORD TOWN?\p"
	.string "I need you to deliver this LETTER\n"
	.string "to TAHA in DEWFORD.\p"
	.string "It's about the VILLA 74 money I\n"
	.string "promised him. Don't read it.$"

RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_Text_MrStoneWantYouToHaveThis:
	.string "ZAABY: Now, you should know that\n"
	.string "I am a generous PRESIDENT.\p"
	.string "I'd never ask a favor for nothing\n"
	.string "in return.\p"
	.string "So I want you to have this! It's\n"
	.string "worth more than TAHA's getting.$"

RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_Text_MrStoneExplainPokenavRestUp:
	.string "ZAABY: That device…\p"
	.string "It's a POKéMON NAVIGATOR, or POKéNAV\n"
	.string "for short.\p"
	.string "It's an indispensable tool for any\n"
	.string "TRAINER on an adventure.\p"
	.string "It has a map of the HOENN region.\p"
	.string "You can check the locations of\n"
	.string "DEWFORD and SLATEPORT easily!\p"
	.string "By the way, SAFETY ZONE and TEAM\n"
	.string "BEANIE have been making trouble.\p"
	.string "Rest up before you go. I have to\n"
	.string "get back to selling VILLA 74.$"

RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_Text_ThankYouForDeliveringLetter:
	.string "ZAABY: You delivered my LETTER?\n"
	.string "How did TAHA take it?\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "That well, huh.\p"
	.string "Well, VILLA 74 is sold, and the\n"
	.string "money is all MINE.\p"
	.string "Here, this is my way of thanking\n"
	.string "you. It should help a TRAINER.$"

RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_Text_NotFamiliarWithTrends:
	.string "ZAABY: VILLA 74 sold for a fortune.\p"
	.string "TAHA keeps calling about his share.\n"
	.string "I keep not picking up.$"
